  "text": "```verilog\nmodule wbxclk #(\n\t\tparameter\tAW=32,\n\t\t\t\tDW=32,\n\t\t\t\tLGFIFO = 5\n\t) (\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_wb_clk, i_reset,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_wb_cyc, i_wb_stb, i_wb_we,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[(AW-1):0]\ti_wb_addr,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[(DW-1):0]\ti_wb_data,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[(DW/8-1):0]\ti_wb_sel,\n\t\toutput\twire\t\t\to_wb_stall,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\to_wb_ack,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[(DW-1):0]\to_wb_data,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\to_wb_err,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_xclk_clk,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\to_xclk_cyc,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\to_xclk_stb,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\to_xclk_we,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[(AW-1):0]\to_xclk_addr,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[(DW-1):0]\to_xclk_data,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[(DW/8-1):0]\to_xclk_sel,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_xclk_stall,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_xclk_ack,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[(DW-1):0]\ti_xclk_data,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\ti_xclk_err\n\t);\n\n\t// FIFO for Wishbone to XCLK domain\n\treg [(AW-1):0] fifo_addr [0:(1<<LGFIFO)-1];\n\treg [(DW-1):0] fifo_data [0:(1<<LGFIFO)-1];\n\treg [(DW/8-1):0] fifo_sel [0:(1<<LGFIFO)-1];\n\treg fifo_we;\n\treg fifo_re;\n\treg [(LGFIFO-1):0] fifo_wptr;\n\treg [(LGFIFO-1):0] fifo_rptr;\n\treg [(LGFIFO):0] fifo_count;\n\n\t// FIFO write logic\n\talways @(posedge i_wb_clk or posedge i_reset) begin\n\t\tif (i_reset) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_wptr <= 0;\n\t\t\tfifo_count <= 0;\n\t\tend else if (fifo_we && !fifo_re) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_addr[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_addr;\n\t\t\tfifo_data[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_data;\n\t\t\tfifo_sel[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_sel;\n\t\t\tfifo_wptr <= fifo_wptr + 1;\n\t\t\tfifo_count <= fifo_count + 1;\n\t\tend else if (!fifo_we && fifo_re) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_rptr <= fifo_rptr + 1;\n\t\t\tfifo_count <= fifo_count - 1;\n\t\tend else if (fifo_we && fifo_re) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_addr[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_addr;\n\t\t\tfifo_data[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_data;\n\t\t\tfifo_sel[fifo_wptr] <= i_wb_sel;\n\t\t\tfifo_wptr <= fifo_wptr + 1;\n\t\t\tfifo_rptr <= fifo_rptr + 1;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// FIFO read logic\n\talways @(posedge i_xclk_clk or posedge i_reset) begin\n\t\tif (i_reset) begin\n\t\t\to_xclk_cyc <= 0;\n\t\t\to_xclk_stb <= 0;\n\t\t\to_xclk_we <= 0;\n\t\t\to_xclk_addr <= 0;\n\t\t\to_xclk_data <= 0;\n\t\t\to_xclk_sel <= 0;\n\t\tend else if (fifo_re) begin\n\t\t\to_xclk_cyc <= 1;\n\t\t\to_xclk_stb <= 1;\n\t\t\to_xclk_we <= fifo_we;\n\t\t\to_xclk_addr <= fifo_addr[fifo_rptr];\n\t\t\to_xclk_data <= fifo_data[fifo_rptr];\n\t\t\to_xclk_sel <= fifo_sel[fifo_rptr];\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\to_xclk_stb <= 0;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// FIFO control logic\n\talways @(posedge i_wb_clk or posedge i_reset) begin\n\t\tif (i_reset) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_we <= 0;\n\t\t\to_wb_stall <= 0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tfifo_we <= i_wb_cyc && i_wb_stb && (fifo_count < (1<<LGFIFO));\n\t\t\to_wb_stall <= !(fifo_count < (1<<LGFIFO));\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\talways @(posedge i_xclk_clk or posedge i_reset) begin\n\t\tif (i_reset) begin\n\t\t\tfifo_re <= 0;\n\t\t\to_wb_ack <= 0;\n\t\t\to_wb_err <= 0;\n\t\t\to_wb_data <= 0;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tfifo_re <= o_xclk_stb && !i_xclk_stall && i_xclk_ack;\n\t\t\to_wb_ack <= i_xclk_ack;\n\t\t\to_wb_err <= i_xclk_err;\n\t\t\to_wb_data <= i_xclk_data;\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
